cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If this repository contributes to your research, publication or benchmark,
  please cite the AirDbM references below.
title: "AirDbM-API-Bench"
abstract: >-
  Python and HTTP API for AirDbM airfoil design by morphing, together with
  AirDbM-Bench: twelve frozen single- and multi-objective optimization problems
  evaluated by a live XFOIL solve, their released reference solutions, and the
  per-evaluation histories of 300 optimizer runs.
